# named-args.tsv is the one corpus file deliberately NOT committed.
#
# It is 1.7 MB, it is keyed by Rakudo version (so it is dead weight on any machine
# running a different Rakudo), and `10-inventory.raku` regenerates it in about three
# seconds. `named-args.raku` also self-heals: on a cache miss it introspects live and
# appends the row.
#
# Everything else here IS committed. fragments/ especially -- that is ~14 agent-hours
# of source reading and cannot be regenerated cheaply. See
# org/llm/traces/raku-named-args-corpus.md.
named-args.tsv
